#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:114
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Text Formatting"
msgstr "Memformat Teks"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:52
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Status tab collects server messages, such as the Message of the Day."
msgstr "Tab Status mengumpulkan pesan server, seperti Pesan Hari Ini."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:55
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The menu bar and the Start menu open every window and tool, from the Channel List to your account settings."
msgstr "Batang menu dan menu Start membuka setiap jendela dan alat, dari Daftar Saluran ke pengaturan akun Anda."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:44
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The nicklist shows who is in the current channel."
msgstr "Daftar panggilan menunjukkan siapa yang ada di saluran saat ini."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:46
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The topic bar above the messages shows the channel topic and its modes."
msgstr "Topik bar di atas pesan-pesan menunjukkan topik saluran dan mode nya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:95
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "These help pages are always one click away. Choose Help > Help Topics in the chat to open them. Good places to start:"
msgstr "Halaman bantuan ini selalu satu klik jauhnya. Pilih Bantuan > Bantuan Topics dalam percakapan untuk membukanya. Tempat yang bagus untuk memulai:"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:102
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "UI Overview"
msgstr "Overview UI"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:93
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Where to look next"
msgstr "Dimana melihat berikutnya"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:27
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Your nickname"
msgstr "Nama panggilan Anda"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:115
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "covers bold text, colors and Markdown."
msgstr "meliputi teks tebal, warna dan Markdown."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:103
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "explains each part of the screen."
msgstr "menjelaskan setiap bagian dari layar."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:119
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "explains how your nickname is protected."
msgstr "Menjelaskan bagaimana nama panggilanmu dilindungi."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:107
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "lists everything you can type."
msgstr "tampilkan semua yang dapat anda ketik."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:111
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "shows how to talk to one person."
msgstr "Menunjukkan bagaimana berbicara dengan satu orang."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:74
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Talk to one person in private:"
msgstr "Berbicara dengan satu orang secara pribadi:"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:29
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Every nickname is registered with a password. The first time you use a new nickname, the connect screen asks you to choose a password."
msgstr "Setiap nama panggilan terdaftar dengan password. Pertama kali Anda menggunakan nama panggilan baru, layar sambungan meminta Anda untuk memilih sandi."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:34
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "On later visits, enter the same password to log in."
msgstr "Pada kunjungan berikutnya, masukkan sandi yang sama untuk log masuk."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:33
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Then click %{button}."
msgstr "Kemudian klik %{button}."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/connecting.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "\"Alice\" and \"alice\" are the same nickname."
msgstr "\"Alice\" and \"alice\" are the same nickname."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/connecting.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Capital letters do not matter"
msgstr "Huruf kapital tidak masalah"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/connecting.html.heex:26
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "It is shown as you type it."
msgstr "Hal ini ditampilkan sebagai Anda mengetik itu."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:69
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Everybody in a channel sees its visitors under Visitors, at the foot of the user list, and counted in the number beside the channel. A visitor is not a member: they cannot write, have no role, and leave the list when they close the tab."
msgstr "Semua orang di saluran melihat pengunjung di bawah Pengunjung, di kaki dari daftar pengguna, dan dihitung dalam nomor di samping saluran. Pengunjung bukan anggota: mereka tidak dapat menulis, tidak memiliki peran, dan meninggalkan daftar ketika mereka menutup tab."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:83
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Guest names are reserved: nobody can register one or change to one"
msgstr "Nama tamu dipesan: tidak ada yang dapat mendaftar satu atau perubahan ke satu"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:88
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Nothing is kept for a visitor; a new visit gets a new guest name"
msgstr "Tidak ada yang disimpan untuk pengunjung, kunjungan baru mendapat nama tamu baru"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:27
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Open other channels from the sidebar, from Browse all, or from a #channel link in a message"
msgstr "Buka kanal lain dari bilah sisi, dari Ramban semua, atau dari link #channel dalam suatu pesan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:96
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Public Channel Archive"
msgstr "Arsip Saluran Publik"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:24
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Read the public channels as they happen, and scroll back through them"
msgstr "Baca saluran publik seperti yang terjadi, dan gulir kembali melalui mereka"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:77
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Secret, private, invite-only and keyed channels cannot be watched — a channel that becomes one closes for its visitors"
msgstr "Rahasia, pribadi, invite- saja dan saluran dikupas tidak dapat diawasi - saluran yang menjadi salah satu menutup untuk pengunjung"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:33
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "See who is in each channel, and close a channel's tab when you are done"
msgstr "Lihat siapa yang ada di setiap saluran, dan tutup tab saluran ketika Anda selesai"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:48
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Taking part"
msgstr "Mengambil bagian"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:67
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Visitors in the user list"
msgstr "Pengunjung dalam daftar pengguna"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/connecting.html.heex:74
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Watching Without an Account"
msgstr "Menonton Tanpa Akun"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:21
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What you can do"
msgstr "Apa yang dapat Anda lakukan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "You do not need an account to look around. Open the chat and you land in #lobby with the conversation arriving live, under a guest name such as Guest4821 that you get for the visit."
msgstr "Anda tidak perlu account untuk melihat-lihat. Buka chat dan Anda mendarat di #lobby dengan percakapan tiba hidup, di bawah nama tamu seperti Guest4821 yang Anda dapatkan untuk kunjungan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/connecting.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Cannot be a visitor name such as %{example}"
msgstr "Tidak dapat nama pengunjung seperti %{example}"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:74
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "Batas"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:56
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Everything that does something needs an account: writing, reacting, the menus and settings, games, calls, spaces, private sessions — and following any link, whether to a game or to another site. Each of them opens the Connect window instead, saying which feature it was."
msgstr "Segala sesuatu yang melakukan sesuatu membutuhkan akun: menulis, bereaksi, menu dan pengaturan, permainan, panggilan, ruang, sesi pribadi - dan mengikuti link apapun, apakah permainan atau situs lain. Masing-masing membuka jendela koneksi, mengatakan yang fitur itu."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:62
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A link to a game, a call or a space opens the chat with that window, and after you sign in it takes you to the link."
msgstr "Sebuah link ke permainan, panggilan atau ruang membuka percakapan dengan jendela itu, dan setelah Anda masuk itu membawa Anda ke link."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_connect_window.html.heex:55
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "It behaves like every other window: move it, minimize it, or bring it back from its taskbar button. Closing it takes you back to the chat; after signing in you land where you were going — the channel you were reading, or the game or call that asked you to sign in."
msgstr "Ia berperilaku seperti setiap jendela lain: memindahkannya, meminimalisir, atau membawanya kembali dari tombol taskbar. Menutup itu membawa Anda kembali ke chatting; setelah menandatangani di tanah Anda di mana Anda akan - saluran yang Anda baca, atau permainan atau panggilan yang meminta Anda untuk masuk"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:42
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Share a channel: its address is /c/ followed by its name, and the address bar shows it while the channel is in front"
msgstr "Berbagi suatu saluran: alamatnya /c / diikuti dengan namanya, dan bilah alamat menunjukkannya ketika kanal berada di depan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_connect_window.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Connect window is where you sign in. It opens over the chat at its own address, /connect — from Create an account on the home, or from anything you try that needs an account — so you sign in without leaving the desktop you arrived on."
msgstr "Jendela penghubung adalah tempat kau mendaftar. Ini membuka melalui percakapan di alamat sendiri, /connect - dari Membuat akun di rumah, atau dari apa pun yang Anda coba yang membutuhkan akun - sehingga Anda masuk tanpa meninggalkan desktop Anda tiba di."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:50
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Where the message box would be, a bar says you are watching as a visitor. Its Create an account to talk button opens the Connect window, and once you sign in you come back to the same channel."
msgstr "Dimana kotak pesan akan, bar mengatakan Anda menonton sebagai pengunjung. Its Membuat akun untuk bicara tombol membuka jendela Sambung, dan setelah Anda masuk Anda kembali ke saluran yang sama."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:8
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "At the bottom of the conversation, a System line greets you by your guest name."
msgstr "Pada bagian bawah percakapan, Garis Sistem menyapa Anda dengan nama tamu Anda."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Each feature it names opens its help topic."
msgstr "Setiap fitur itu nama membuka topik bantuannya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:12
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "It shows how to move between channels and what an account opens, with a button to create one."
msgstr "Ini menunjukkan bagaimana bergerak antara saluran dan apa yang dibuka akun, dengan tombol untuk menciptakan satu."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:19
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Every visit greets you again."
msgstr "Setiap kunjungan menyapa Anda lagi."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:18
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "It goes away when you open another channel."
msgstr "Itu akan hilang ketika kau membuka saluran lain."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:17
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Only you see it."
msgstr "Hanya kau yang melihatnya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:36
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Read what every member reads on arrival: the message of the day in Status, and a channel's welcome when you open it"
msgstr "Baca apa yang setiap anggota baca saat kedatangan: pesan hari ini di Status, dan sebuah saluran diterima ketika Anda membukanya"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_connect_window.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Type a nickname and click Continue. A nickname nobody has registered opens a short registration form; a registered one asks for its password. Either way you land in the chat already identified."
msgstr "Ketik nama panggilan dan klik Lanjutkan. Nama panggilan tidak ada yang terdaftar membuka formulir pendaftaran singkat; yang terdaftar meminta kata sandinya. Bagaimanapun juga kau mendarat di chat yang sudah diidentifikasi."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_connect_window.html.heex:31
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What each terminal is — its browser, its system, when it was last used — is in Trusted Terminals, in the Start menu."
msgstr "Apa yang setiap terminal - peramban, sistem, ketika terakhir digunakan - adalah dalam Terminals Trusted, dalam menu Start."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_connect_window.html.heex:27
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Log in with another nickname opens an empty field, and Back to the list goes back."
msgstr "Log in dengan nama panggilan lain membuka field kosong, dan Kembali ke daftar kembali."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_connect_window.html.heex:21
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Tick Remember this terminal when you log in, and this browser remembers your nickname. Next time, the window lists your nicknames instead of an empty field. Click Log in beside one and you are in, without a password."
msgstr "Tik Ingat terminal ini ketika Anda masuk, dan peramban ini mengingat nama panggilan Anda. Lain kali, jendela daftar nama panggilan Anda bukan lapangan kosong. Klik Log di samping satu dan Anda berada dalam, tanpa password."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_connect_window.html.heex:48
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "After you disconnect, or when a session ends, this window opens instead of the chat. Auto-login starts again when you close the browser, or when you log in here."
msgstr "Setelah Anda memutuskan, atau ketika sesi berakhir, jendela ini terbuka, bukan obrolan. Log masuk otomatis dimulai lagi ketika Anda menutup peramban, atau ketika Anda log masuk di sini."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_connect_window.html.heex:44
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Auto-login is set per terminal and per nickname, so a shared computer can stay manual."
msgstr "Log masuk otomatis diatur setiap terminal dan setiap nama panggilan, sehingga komputer bersama dapat tetap manual."
